		{
			"id":"a4c487a7becdea67",
			"type":"text",
			"text":"You can combine these rooms together with the Drawing Room experiment from the Laboratory to reroll until you draw a Drawing Room, reroll using gem and then rewind with Chronograph to trigger the experiment again.\n\nWith this it's possible to trigger an experiment more than 40 times in a run.",
